For example, if `numList` looks like this:

```
[4] -> [2] -> [4] -> [9] -> [4] -> NULL
```

`listCount(numList, 4)` should return 3, `listCount(numList, 8)` should return 0, and `listCount(NULL, 4)` should return 0.

questions.answer:
```c
int listCount(LinkedList list, int value) {
    int count = 0;
    while (list != NULL) {
        if (list->data == value) {
            count++;
        }
        list = list->next;
    }
    return count;
}
